#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Do you play Singles or Doubles Tournaments? This plugin manages Rotation Tournaments where players have a different partner in each game."
msgstr "Organizujete turnaje vo dvojhre alebo vo štvorhre? Tento plugin spravuje rotačné turnaje, v ktorých majú hráči v každej hre iného partnera."

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Rotation Tournaments"
msgstr "Rotačné turnaje"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "After installation, go to the app's settings and enter the address of your website where this plugin is installed."
msgstr "Po inštalácii prejdite do nastavení aplikácie a zadajte adresu webu, na ktorom je tento plugin nainštalovaný."

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "Or download it directly from this link: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"
msgstr "Alebo si ju stiahnite priamo z tohto odkazu: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "Search for \"Rotation Tournaments\" on the Google Play Store."
msgstr "Vyhľadajte v Obchode Google Play „Rotation Tournaments“."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "To get the full experience of managing tournaments on the go, download our mobile app, now available on Google Play!"
msgstr "Ak si chcete naplno užiť správu turnajov na cestách, stiahnite si našu mobilnú aplikáciu, ktorá je už dostupná na Google Play!"

